# Arena IRICE-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1, the user's config (expressive motion, Colloid, their 4 widgets).
# Each file runs top to bottom from a fresh desktop. `static NAME x y w h`: that region must not change
# from there until the next `shot`, `rec` or `look` (the no-reload blocks end with their last close).
# Right-clicks: `ptr ... down up` lines marked (right button) need the runner's right button.

look glass
rec sc-click 2 ptr move 604 175 click
note App Drawer tile: the launchpad opens (log: tessera-ui: desktop shortcut "App Drawer")
key -k Escape
wait 0.8
rec sc-drag-tile 3 ptr move 600 130 down glide 600 330 400 glide 1400 330 400 up
note the whole Shortcuts widget follows from 6 px (1.04), ghost shows; on release it springs into the cell; no action runs; config desktop.widgets changed
ptr move 1400 330 down glide 600 130 400 up
wait 1
note right-click a tile (600,130): the widget's menu opens
key -k Escape
rec sc-hover 2 ptr move 440 100 glide 520 100 300 glide 600 100 300 glide 680 100 300
note hovered tile brightens (Glass tint 0.18→0.26, 150 ms; Material 8 % layer)
rec sc-press 1.5 ptr move 440 100 down sleep 500 up
note Glass: 0.95 in 100 ms; Material: swells ≈4 %, corners 20→12, bounces past 1 on release
note no reload: widgets must not fade or grow in again while windows open, focus and close (only the clock's minute may change)
ptr move 1500 600
shot sc-before
setup sh -c "foot & sleep 0.8; hyprctl dispatch \"hl.dsp.window.move({ workspace = 'special:parity', follow = false, window = 'class:foot' })\""
shot sc-after-open-1
setup sh -c "foot & sleep 0.8; hyprctl dispatch \"hl.dsp.window.move({ workspace = 'special:parity', follow = false, window = 'class:foot' })\""
shot sc-after-open-2
note the after-open shots equal the before shot over the widgets (no widget at 0.9 scale or faded)
static sc-clock 32 54 344 164
static sc-stack 32 234 344 164
static sc-batteries 32 414 344 164
static sc-shortcuts 392 54 344 164
ptr move 1300 700 click
wait 1
setup hyprctl dispatch 'hl.dsp.window.close({ window = "class:foot" })'
wait 1.5
setup hyprctl dispatch 'hl.dsp.window.close({ window = "class:foot" })'
wait 1.5
setup python3 -c "import json,os;p=os.path.expanduser('~/.config/tessera/config.json');c=json.load(open(p));c.setdefault('desktop',{})['widgets']=json.loads('[\"clock:m:0:0\", \"stack:m:0:1:pz3mh8\", \"batteries:m:0:2\", \"shortcuts:m:2:0:5a2cav\"]');json.dump(c,open(p,'w'),indent=4)"
wait 1

